# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key

# ── Go ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anchored to the repo root so it never matches the cmd/opencircuit/ source
# directory. An unanchored binary name matches at any depth and silently
# excludes source — this bit the ShortLinks repo (its issue #0001).
/opencircuit
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# ── Node / Vite ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.vite/

# The built SPA is generated by `npm run build` and embedded via //go:embed.
# dist/index.html is committed as a minimal placeholder so `go build ./...`
# compiles from a clean checkout before any npm build has run — do NOT commit
# a real built index.html over it.
web/dist/*
!web/dist/index.html

# ── Editors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Transient agent state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CERBERUS.md

# Subagent git worktrees. Anchored (leading slash) so it matches only the
# repo-root directory the agent runner creates — an unanchored pattern would
# match a `.claude/worktrees` at any depth. See CLAUDE.md §8: the same anchoring
# mistake on the binary name silently excluded cmd/opencircuit/ in ShortLinks.
/.claude/worktrees/

# ── Server-managed workshop photos ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Workshop cover images are placed on the server directly (referenced by
# workshops.cover_image) and are deliberately NOT in source control — the
# user's decision, 2026-09-04, recorded in issues/0416.md. `npm run build`
# sweeps web/public/ into the embedded dist/, so they reach the site from the
# deploy checkout without ever being committed.
#
# Anchored and extension-scoped on purpose. web/public/ also holds 23 tracked,
# load-bearing design assets — fonts, favicons, the logo and mark variants, the
# hero-crt webp set, og-default.png — and a broader pattern would invite
# ignoring those too. See CLAUDE.md §8 on the anchoring mistake that silently
# excluded cmd/opencircuit/ in ShortLinks.
/web/public/*.jpg
/web/public/*.jpeg
